  "solution": {
    "text": "Given,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />Let,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math>, then we get,<br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />which represents a square of side length equal to <math><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/091aa721-604d-4478-a296-df4da708699d.png\" style=\"width:1.65347in;height:1.47986in\" /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math>&nbsp;The perimeter of the locus is <math><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;units",
